    "summary": "Apply **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** only against an **INFANTRY** unit. A critical wound gives no save and deals the attack’s Damage as mortal wounds after normal damage. Any excess from that attack is lost when its recipient is destroyed. Feel No Pain still applies.",
